     "Women get UTI more often because of a short urethra close to the anus.",
     "Urine flow and bladder emptying are the main defences; Tamm-Horsfall protein traps type 1-fimbriated bacteria.",
     "Urine antigen tests belong to pneumonia diagnostics, not UTI – UTI is diagnosed by culture.",
     "NMEC and UPEC are both ExPEC, but NMEC relies on the K1 capsule."
